sequenceDiagram
    participant Manager
    participant CaptureAgent
    participant ReviewStorageAgent
    Manager->>CaptureAgent: Provide route manifest and run contract
    CaptureAgent->>CaptureAgent: Start app once
    loop Each screenshot-candidate route
        CaptureAgent->>CaptureAgent: Navigate with Playwright MCP and capture screenshot
    end
    CaptureAgent->>ReviewStorageAgent: Send screenshot set and browser evidence
    ReviewStorageAgent->>ReviewStorageAgent: Review every image and store accepted image assets
    ReviewStorageAgent->>Manager: Return route-to-asset map and findings
